674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cZeeIkaodR4Q7kNvwGwEZ0w&_nc_oc=Adp689dXI4qoQTE77jR5QSEJsuibEInUMNKXNT4dy_r3Z7nBDvmxUkd6dHM_rpQY974&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0u99ReDm68FnT2FeOd-0_CRzn2R_cbpywtYlwUtj4_vw&oe=69DE4FD9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XY_Cr4Kr3GYQ7kNvwEEaghJ&_nc_oc=AdpppiPrf8r6BlCu-E2LQQMEkZMwTp34sbskmls4quNiO7jWsKOdpaaD_1fKuy4zlG0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1n5wji093PAHIwTYdfe-FkD7EPCfx-ewMdtwgIqbd0-Q&oe=69DE2056"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6wqD9TbHOvUQ7kNvwGdZrc-&_nc_oc=Adoi3-rVg1TnmezGyhsiprGefV8yu1Mq1S8Hff3Ao98_gPamWAc5aj1M14TwbqHJDpE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0grpFEnDrUFzSx1WMg8JaaP4IAJR9belJVn6i6qWywqg&oe=69DE54B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip